 =?UTF-8?q?processing,=20floating-point=20vectors,=20structure=20loads=20a?=
 =?UTF-8?q?nd=20stores,=20scalar=20SIMD=20forms?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Shifts (SHL, USHR, SSHR, USRA, SSRA, rounding and accumulating forms, SLI, SRI, USHLL/SSHLL, SHLL, narrowing SHRN/RSHRN/SQSHRN/SQRSHRN, XTN), permutes (UZP, ZIP, TRN),
compares and halving/saturating/rounding arithmetic (USHL, SSHL, CMHI, CMHS, SHADD..., SQADD..., MUL, MLA, MLS, SQDMULH, SQRDMULH, SABD..., SABA...), REV, CNT, CLZ, CLS, NEG, ABS,
UADDLP/SADDLP/UADALP, UADDLV, ORN, BIC/ORR immediate, TBL, DUP/INS element, widening multiply/add (SMULL..., SADDL..., SADDW...), by-element forms, FADD/FSUB/FMUL/FDIV/FMIN/FMAX/FABD/
FMLA/FMLS and compares on 2S/4S/2D with ARM's default NaN and the host's exception flags, FNEG/FABS/FSQRT/FRINT*, SCVTF/UCVTF/FCVTZ* (also fixed point), FCVTN/FCVTL, FMOV immediate,
LD1..LD4/ST1..ST4 (multiple structures, one lane, post-index) and LD1R..LD4R, scalar SIMD forms, SMSUBL/UMSUBL, LDURSB/LDURSH to X. Development aid: REMILL_DUMP_INST=1 prints what the
decoder made of each instruction.
